    "message": "feat(claude): mcc-claude / fcc-claude set ENABLE_WEB_SERVER_TOOLS=true\n\nThe mcc-claude / fcc-claude launcher (both entry points resolve to\ncli.launchers.claude:launch) now forces ENABLE_WEB_SERVER_TOOLS=true on the\nchild Claude Code session. Web server tools require the proxy-side execution\npath, so sessions launched through the proxy should always have them. Set\nunconditionally in build_minimal_claude_proxy_env (the env policy used only by\nthis launcher) and documented; the -old / legacy launcher is unchanged.\n\nVerified: 13 claude launcher/env tests pass including the two env-shape tests\nnow asserting ENABLE_WEB_SERVER_TOOLS=true; full test_entrypoints.py 84 pass;\n2 test_web_server_tools.py failures are pre-existing on unmodified fork/main.\nruff format/check and ty clean.\n\nVersion 5.2.2 -> 5.3.0 (launcher behavior addition).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
